<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Those with the ability to change their own fate are to be feared and respected; destroy them, follow behind them, or fall before them.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.description>Those with the ability to change their own fate are to be feared and respected; destroy them, follow behind them, or fall before them.</TM_Transcendent.description>
  <!--EN: creation(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           ->Drifting in an eternity of magic, [deity0_name] gazed upon the physical worlds and saw anguish and strife, where the few used the power of machines and archotech to prey upon the many. Wishing to restore balance, [deity0_name] weaved threads of [deity0_possessive] power into the essence of all humankind, granting them the ability to touch and the will to use magic.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0>creation(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           -&amp;gt;Drifting in an eternity of magic, [deity0_name] gazed upon the physical worlds and saw anguish and strife, where the few used the power of machines and archotech to prey upon the many. Wishing to restore balance, [deity0_name] weaved threads of [deity0_possessive] power into the essence of all humankind, granting them the ability to touch and the will to use magic.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0>
  <!--EN: episode(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)     ->Magic, granted to good and evil alike, was used uncaringly and threatened to sunder the earth, causing pain and chaos to all. [deity0_name], seeing that humankind did not yet have the maturity for self-control, reduced the flow of mana to a trickle, striking the knowledge of its use from the minds of its weilders. Thus, magic became a rarity, where its use was requisite upon the dedication and energy of its stewards.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1>episode(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)     -&amp;gt;Magic, granted to good and evil alike, was used uncaringly and threatened to sunder the earth, causing pain and chaos to all. [deity0_name], seeing that humankind did not yet have the maturity for self-control, reduced the flow of mana to a trickle, striking the knowledge of its use from the minds of its weilders. Thus, magic became a rarity, where its use was requisite upon the dedication and energy of its stewards.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1>
  <!--EN: lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent) ->In order to attain true power, we must give up the objects that provide stability and allow us to remain weak.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10>lessonReinforcement(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent) -&amp;gt;In order to attain true power, we must give up the objects that provide stability and allow us to remain weak.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.10>
  <!--EN: archistBasis(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       ->When the archotechs appeared they were never concerned for appearances; they showed us that the mind stands above the physical form.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11>archistBasis(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       -&amp;gt;When the archotechs appeared they were never concerned for appearances; they showed us that the mind stands above the physical form.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.11>
  <!--EN: archistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        ->Archotechs did not foresee the seed of magic within humankind and their instructions to achieve enlightenment took an unforseen turn.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12>archistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        -&amp;gt;Archotechs did not foresee the seed of magic within humankind and their instructions to achieve enlightenment took an unforseen turn.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.12>
  <!--EN: archistProphecy(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)    ->[inTheEnd], humankind was able to achieve a new form of enlightenment through the revelation and connection to magic.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13>archistProphecy(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)    -&amp;gt;[inTheEnd], humankind was able to achieve a new form of enlightenment through the revelation and connection to magic.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.13>
  <!--EN: animistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        ->The spirit realm draws ever closer with the permeation of magic; the veil of spirits can be parted momentarily for those strong in magic, and even crossed if the price is paid.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14>animistFact(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        -&amp;gt;The spirit realm draws ever closer with the permeation of magic; the veil of spirits can be parted momentarily for those strong in magic, and even crossed if the price is paid.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.14>
  <!--EN: intro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              ->At the [place_summary] [place_name], the ritual of true birth began at the [diety0_type] [altarRoomLabel] of [deity0_name] where the terrified yet desperate [founderName] reached out with intensity and ferver to create a path through sheer strength of will. [diety0_name], witnessing this unfathomable strength of spirit, bestowed upon [founderName] a connection to magic.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2>intro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              -&amp;gt;At the [place_summary] [place_name], the ritual of true birth began at the [diety0_type] [altarRoomLabel] of [deity0_name] where the terrified yet desperate [founderName] reached out with intensity and ferver to create a path through sheer strength of will. [diety0_name], witnessing this unfathomable strength of spirit, bestowed upon [founderName] a connection to magic.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2>
  <!--EN: conflict(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           ->A violent [foeLeader] tried to seize this power, killing many to reach [place_name].-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3>conflict(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)           -&amp;gt;A violent [foeLeader] tried to seize this power, killing many to reach [place_name].</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.3>
  <!--EN: founderJoin(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        ->[deity0_name] commanded [founderName] to learn the ways of magic and defend [founder_possessive] tribe. [founderName] spent every waking hour communing with [deity0_name] at [altarRoomLabel].-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4>founderJoin(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)        -&amp;gt;[deity0_name] commanded [founderName] to learn the ways of magic and defend [founder_possessive] tribe. [founderName] spent every waking hour communing with [deity0_name] at [altarRoomLabel].</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.4>
  <!--EN: victory(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)            ->Consumed by an ocean of malice, [foeLeader] marched [foeLeader_possessive] armies upon [place_name] to kill [founderName]. Yet, on the day of reckoning, [founderName] emerged from [founder_possessive] communion with [diety0_name] and called forth a storm of [TM_stormType] and [TM_stormType], utterly destroying the armies of [foeLeader]. Thus, the bloodline of magic took hold and began to spread its roots throughout [place_summary].-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5>victory(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)            -&amp;gt;Consumed by an ocean of malice, [foeLeader] marched [foeLeader_possessive] armies upon [place_name] to kill [founderName]. Yet, on the day of reckoning, [founderName] emerged from [founder_possessive] communion with [diety0_name] and called forth a storm of [TM_stormType] and [TM_stormType], utterly destroying the armies of [foeLeader]. Thus, the bloodline of magic took hold and began to spread its roots throughout [place_summary].</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.5>
  <!--EN: setup(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              ->[founderName] fought in many battles for his urbworld overlords, seeing much grief, dispare, and death. Exhausted from the senselessness, [founder_pronoun] threw away his weapons and vowed to [diety0_name] to shape [founder_possessive] future in the pursuit of peace and prosperity instead of violence.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6>setup(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              -&amp;gt;[founderName] fought in many battles for his urbworld overlords, seeing much grief, dispare, and death. Exhausted from the senselessness, [founder_pronoun] threw away his weapons and vowed to [diety0_name] to shape [founder_possessive] future in the pursuit of peace and prosperity instead of violence.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.6>
  <!--EN: story(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       ->[founderName] preached the peaceful way as the true way to eternal life and was granted powerful [diety0_type] magic from his patron diety [diety0_name].-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7>story(uses=1,tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)       -&amp;gt;[founderName] preached the peaceful way as the true way to eternal life and was granted powerful [diety0_type] magic from his patron diety [diety0_name].</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.7>
  <!--EN: lessonIntro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)         ->In order to empower ourselves, we must first give up the technologies and contraptions that stunt our growth. Only then can the struggle to survive change us.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8>lessonIntro(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)         -&amp;gt;In order to empower ourselves, we must first give up the technologies and contraptions that stunt our growth. Only then can the struggle to survive change us.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.8>
  <!--EN: lesson(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              ->We grow and adapt by overcoming challenges.-->
  <TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9>lesson(tag=meme_TM_Transcendent)              -&amp;gt;We grow and adapt by overcoming challenges.</TM_Transcendent.descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.9>
